"output "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Position"},{"type":"text","text":" to the layer’s transform. When released near the center, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"card snaps back to its resting position."}]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/onSubmit(of:_:)":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onSubmit"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"of"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI14SubmitTriggersV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SubmitTriggers"},{"kind":"text","text":", () -> "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Void"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View","preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP"}],"title":"onSubmit(of:_:)","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/onSubmit(of:_:)","url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/onsubmit(of:_:)","role":"symbol","abstract":[]},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami":{"title":"Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An Origami → SwiftUI translator: a deterministic parser reads Facebook’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".origami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"patch graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"kind":"symbol","type":"topic"}}}